[{"y0": 0.044977339088824286, "y1": 0.06258080061448124, "x0": 0.1785417007788126, "x1": 0.25754852365785047, "t": "GATE"}, {"y0": 0.0465116280750707, "y1": 0.06249999995303002, "x0": 0.2875939907261634, "x1": 0.7180450998440121, "t": "Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering 2021"}, {"y0": 0.060165863932068575, "y1": 0.07936901991203427, "x0": 0.18013332260165404, "x1": 0.25783660124187496, "t": "2021"}, {"y0": 0.06540697686988661, "y1": 0.08139534874784593, "x0": 0.334586462010652, "x1": 0.6597744321152881, "t": "Organising Institute - IIT Bombay"}, {"y0": 0.0901162790839487, "y1": 0.10755813962971406, "x0": 0.3308270563463581, "x1": 0.8477443657636043, "t": "Computer Science and Information Technology (CS, Set-1)"}, {"y0": 0.1424418605388187, "y1": 0.15697674374897197, "x0": 0.16353383477647254, "x1": 0.20112781982879058, "t": "Q.47"}, {"y0": 0.1424242425366895, "y1": 0.1569767438683657, "x0": 0.23496241312637586, "x1": 0.6766917285223888, "t": "Consider a dynamic hashing approach for 4-bit integer keys:"}, {"y0": 0.15818181825301292, "y1": 0.170303030374225, "x0": 0.23684211654352383, "x1": 0.5206766875448219, "t": "1. There is a main hash table of size 4."}, {"y0": 0.1744186050786326, "y1": 0.18749999962097985, "x0": 0.23496242139534693, "x1": 0.8233082749079106, "t": "2. The 2 least significant bits of a key is used to index into the main hash table."}, {"y0": 0.1903030300966807, "y1": 0.203636363430014, "x0": 0.23684211301534158, "x1": 0.6052631593530792, "t": "3. Initially, the main hash table entries are empty."}, {"y0": 0.20639534931312875, "y1": 0.219476743855476, "x0": 0.23496239527067916, "x1": 0.8364661561077678, "t": "4. Thereafter, when more keys are hashed into it, to resolve collisions, the set of"}, {"y0": 0.22238372138798335, "y1": 0.23575757547604415, "x0": 0.25563909965504883, "x1": 0.8364661489821696, "t": "all keys corresponding to a main hash table entry is organized as a binary tree"}, {"y0": 0.23818181824503837, "y1": 0.2500000000632202, "x0": 0.2556390974943554, "x1": 0.42669172529699795, "t": "that grows on demand."}, {"y0": 0.2514534883852334, "y1": 0.2660606057780335, "x0": 0.23496239903007748, "x1": 0.8364661598671661, "t": "5. First, the 3rd least significant bit is used to divide the keys into left and right"}, {"y0": 0.270111370679311, "y1": 0.2807607223194921, "x0": 0.255582308271536, "x1": 0.3252447611367061, "t": "subtrees."}, {"y0": 0.2848484845669532, "y1": 0.2981818179002865, "x0": 0.23496239869956106, "x1": 0.834586458490289, "t": "6. To resolve more collisions, each node of the binary tree is further sub-divided"}, {"y0": 0.3006060604669185, "y1": 0.31395348795067946, "x0": 0.2537594170049758, "x1": 0.727443602355926, "t": "into left and right subtrees based on the 4' least significant bit."}, {"y0": 0.3168604651122918, "y1": 0.3345454548102973, "x0": 0.23308270967165173, "x1": 0.7631578785802282, "t": "7. A split is done only if it is needed, i.e., only when there is a collision."}, {"y0": 0.33139534895927625, "y1": 0.34738372083723545, "x0": 0.23496241497304143, "x1": 0.5733082684856051, "t": "Consider the following state of the hash table."}, {"y0": 0.3648255815708281, "y1": 0.3749999999335323, "x0": 0.37406015091239564, "x1": 0.4003759386552735, "t": "00"}, {"y0": 0.36337209337199494, "y1": 0.3764534879143422, "x0": 0.5676691729945968, "x1": 0.5996240608869821, "t": "10"}, {"y0": 0.3895348839606577, "y1": 0.40261627850300497, "x0": 0.3665413543203688, "x1": 0.4116541345894056, "t": "empty"}, {"y0": 0.39098837198565173, "y1": 0.3997093022585343, "x0": 0.4605263156842497, "x1": 0.46992481194732916, "t": "0"}, {"y0": 0.3895348835777681, "y1": 0.4011627906082783, "x0": 0.5526315792860851, "x1": 0.5657894731575239, "t": "0"}, {"y0": 0.4575757574911212, "y1": 0.4696969696123334, "x0": 0.23496239777694464, "x1": 0.8364661586140333, "t": "Which of the following sequences of key insertions can cause the above state of the"}, {"y0": 0.4738372091881481, "y1": 0.4869186048864642, "x0": 0.23308270508019585, "x1": 0.6296992431967466, "t": "hash table (assume the keys are in decimal notation)?"}, {"y0": 0.5188953490199234, "y1": 0.5334302322300767, "x0": 0.18984962487272708, "x1": 0.21992481171875164, "t": "(A)"}, {"y0": 0.5181126581730146, "y1": 0.5356664118813627, "x0": 0.23291958575977545, "x1": 0.35542628049368513, "t": "5, 9, 4, 13, 10, 7"}, {"y0": 0.5668604652989931, "y1": 0.5813953485091464, "x0": 0.19172932412084734, "x1": 0.2218045109668719, "t": "(B)"}, {"y0": 0.566391091783148, "y1": 0.5833182109515163, "x0": 0.23297459221515235, "x1": 0.3459727773280846, "t": "9, 5, 10, 6, 7, 1"}, {"y0": 0.61337209315735, "y1": 0.6308139537031152, "x0": 0.18984962366658933, "x1": 0.2218045115589746, "t": "(C)"}, {"y0": 0.6142684463192439, "y1": 0.6313710889565546, "x0": 0.23108700008735794, "x1": 0.35537916447435836, "t": "10, 9, 6, 7, 5, 13"}, {"y0": 0.664242424120711, "y1": 0.6775757574540443, "x0": 0.1898496244851192, "x1": 0.22744360953743722, "t": "(D) |"}, {"y0": 0.6642424241000345, "y1": 0.6787878786454892, "x0": 0.22932330853555205, "x1": 0.36278195128587654, "t": "9, 5, 13, 6, 10, 14"}, {"y0": 0.9460606063217823, "y1": 0.9593939396551157, "x0": 0.156015044495601, "x1": 0.3966165392637975, "t": "CS, Set-1 - Copyright \u00a9 GATE 2021"}, {"y0": 0.9452422390433941, "y1": 0.9602810171750525, "x0": 0.7535481512896117, "x1": 0.847955606590448, "t": "Page 37 of 40"}]